Subject: Cantor B1 Public Verifying Key Revocation Snapshot Verification P0 Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 636de723-6413-4b7c-a14b-5489ff162b81

& [Why]
  + A3 is the first unresolved dependency after published A2 and supplies the status assertion needed before A4 can compare declared validity with trusted current time
  + verifying raw target interval and signature correspondence is useful and deterministic without contacting a revocation service

& [WhyNotAuthority]
  + a mathematically valid signature does not establish responder authorization registry completeness newest sequence freshness or current operative revocation truth
  + keeping those fields false prevents a fixture good assertion from laundering execution authority

& [Decision]
  + authorize only bounded provider-free correspondence implementation after full formation replay
